<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τομός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting, sharp,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				61e
			</span></i>, Timo <i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμηρόν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μὲν σφαγεὺς ἕστηκεν ᾗ
				τομώτατος</span> as it will <i>cut sharpest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				815
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος -ώτερος σιδήρου</span>
				Ps.<i><span class="en">
				Phoc.
				124
			</span></i>. cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
				4.12
			</span></i>; of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ -ώτατοι</span>
			the <i>sharpest, hottest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				78
			</span></i> codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέω τιτομώτερον ἣ ἀπὸ δάφνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Del.</u>
					94
				</span></i>
			 codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράξεις -ώτεραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tox.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορός.</span>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μῶς</span>”
				<i>sharply, clearly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τμήδην.</span>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
